const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文在严格资本市场假设下提出关于融资结构、资本成本和投资的基准命题。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article establishes benchmark propositions about financing structure, cost of capital, and investment under restrictive capital-market assumptions. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它是理论基准分析，命题依赖税收、交易成本、信息、契约和资本市场完备性假设，而不是公司级预测样本。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It is theoretical benchmark analysis: the propositions depend on the assumptions about taxes, transaction costs, information, contracting, and capital-market completeness rather than on a firm-level predictive sample. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"实证延展需要带日期的融资工具与条款、税收、发行和困境成本、所有权与信息摩擦、投资机会以及清晰反事实。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"An empirical extension would need dated financing instruments and terms, taxes, issuance and distress costs, ownership and information frictions, investment opportunities, and a clearly stated counterfactual. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"该框架说明在既定假设下可推出什么，并帮助识别后续摩擦为何重要；它不决定单个公司的最优资本结构或当前资本成本。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The framework clarifies what follows under its assumptions and why later frictions matter; it does not determine an individual company's optimal capital structure or current cost of capital. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"列出维持假设；定义现金流索取权和税收处理；区分账面与市值杠杆；保留公告时点；解释融资选择前先声明反事实。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"List every maintained assumption; define cash-flow claims and tax treatment; separate book from market leverage; preserve announcement timing; and state the counterfactual before interpreting an observed financing choice. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The American Economic Review · JSTOR record。基准定理不是公司融资建议、估值输出，也不证明现实世界摩擦无关紧要。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The American Economic Review · JSTOR record. A benchmark theorem is not a corporate-finance recommendation, valuation output, or proof that real-world frictions are immaterial. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1809766",label:{zh:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · 来源说明",en:"The American Economic Review · JSTOR record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Cost of Capital, Corporation Finance and the Theory of Investment”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。基准定理不是公司融资建议、估值输出，也不证明现实世界摩擦无关紧要。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Cost of Capital, Corporation Finance and the Theory of Investment”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
